{
  "name": "Occult Association: Prophet / Oracle (Tier 1)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": {
      "revision": 1,
      "rules": "2024",
      "book": ""
    },
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 1 — Prophet / Oracle</strong></p><p><strong>“You don’t know the future. You just know when something has started.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 1, you begin catching the edge of events before they fully arrive. Not enough to command them. Enough to stop being surprised.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain a skill rank in <strong>Insight</strong> and <strong>Perception</strong></li><li>1/Soma Break, ask the GM one focused omen-question about an immediate situation, route, or known danger; the answer should be truthful but limited, symbolic, or pressure-based</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Strategic Turn, before a planning-heavy, reconnaissance, or intrigue-forward action, gain <strong>+2</strong> to one relevant OP roll by declaring what sign your faction is acting on</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> early warning is rarely comfortable. Expect unease, distraction, or tension when you sense something going wrong before anyone else can justify reacting to it.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"prophT1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Omen Question</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Ask the GM one focused omen-question. Truthful but limited / symbolic / pressure-based.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
